From: reaper <theunbounddeveloper@outlook.com>
Date: Thu, 23 Jul 2026 08:50:44 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] version: bump EXTENDNO to Reaper_v1.7.5

Closes the C6 command-injection twin in libpasswd/passwd.c (ASUS PSIRT case
1006563), completing the C6 remediation across every openssl-passwd popen sink.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 release/src-rt/version.conf | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/release/src-rt/version.conf b/release/src-rt/version.conf
index 6fedf88d64..be4186ac1f 100644
--- a/release/src-rt/version.conf
+++ b/release/src-rt/version.conf
@@ -4,6 +4,6 @@ KERNEL_VER_AM=$(subst .,,$(KERNEL_VER))
 FS_VER_AM=$(subst .,,$(FS_VER))
 
 SERIALNO=102.8
-EXTENDNO=Reaper_v1.7.4
+EXTENDNO=Reaper_v1.7.5
 
 RCNO=0
